            <div xml:id="d83">

                <pb facs="0088" n="76" xml:id="pg76"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 European War 1939/21085: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Egypt</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-04-23T19:00:00-04:00">April 23, 1942—7
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>347. From the Under Secretary. Your 608, April 17, 6 p.m. You are assured that
                    the matters to which you refer are receiving immediate attention. [Welles.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
